\\"Learn and physically perform a short self-created hummed melody or song, without instruments, and observe the actual performance and any audible response.\\\",\\\"conditions\\\":\\\"I am alive, outdoors near Lin and Moss, with no musical instrument. I can speak aloud but have no inherited musical mastery. Participation by listeners must remain voluntary.\\\",\\\"inputs\\\":\\\"My own voice, breath, attention and practice time; optionally a short original lyric. No other person's actions are controlled.\\\",\\\"costs\\\":\\\"World time and reasonable vocal effort; exact training requirements, duration and energy costs are unknown.\\\",\\\"effects\\\":\\\"An actual audible vocal performance if feasible, with evidence of what I did and any limitations. No guaranteed enjoyment, listener response, health effect or happiness award.\\\"}},\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"guard\\\":null}],\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"interrupts\\\":[],\\\"notes\\\":[\\\"Berries remain my established food; the owned roots have not been established safe to eat.\\\",\\\"The music request proposes an activity, not mastery or a completed performance.\\\"],\\\"preferences\\\":[\\\"Keep food gathering modest and leave communal stock for others.\\\",\\\"Prefer voluntary shared activities and actual trials over assumed benefits.\\\"],\\\"projects\\\":[],\\\"cares\\\":\\\"Staying healthy, sharing fairly, and discovering worthwhile work and enjoyable company without pressuring others.\\\",\\\"views\\\":{}}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[],"tool_choice":"auto","parallel_tool_calls":true,"prompt_cache_key":"c2d759fc-b5a8-4740-8cb9-7798bfae3f5c","prompt_cache_retention":"24h","text":{"format":{"type":"json_schema","name":"bounded_decision","description":null,"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["queries","result_json"],"properties":{"queries":{"type":"array","maxItems":4,"item